
# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key
.beads/proxieddb/
.claude/worktrees/

# Build output (task build:bin — loam-mce): server, loam, and loamhook
# binaries built side by side so cmd/server's sibling-of-executable lookup
# for loamhook resolves.
/bin/

# Stray `go build` output at the repo root. demo:m5 (loam-rle) built
# cmd/demoenv without -o and committed the 16MB arm64 binary that landed
# here; /bin/ above did not catch it because the target had no output path.
# These names are the repo's own main packages, so an unqualified
# `go build ./cmd/<name>` drops the artifact at the root under that name.
/demoenv
/server
/loam
/loamhook

# Agent gate-run logs. An agent chain committed .gatelogs/integration_run.log
# alongside loam-blc; these are per-run scratch output, not source.
/.gatelogs/
